ZGeo change log
===============

Version 1.36.0 — 2026-11-16
Previous GitHub release: v1.35.0 (2026-11-16)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.36.0 adds a "File name and path check": path length,
invalid and reserved names, case-insensitive collisions and orphaned
sidecar files.

Changes in 1.36.0
-----------------
- Added the "File name and path check":
  - a full path longer than 260 characters is flagged (Windows limit);
  - the characters <>:"|?* and control characters in a file name are
    flagged;
  - reserved Windows names (CON, PRN, AUX, NUL, CLOCK$, COM1-9,
    LPT1-9) and names ending with a space or a dot are flagged;
  - files whose names differ only by case are reported once per
    folder;
  - orphaned sidecar files (roads.dbf, roads.prj, dem.tif.aux.xml and
    similar without the main dataset file) are reported once per
    folder.
- The check only reports problems and never renames or moves files.
- The check is optional and disabled by default and applies to all
  file categories, including rasters.
- Russian and English interface strings, README, metadata and tests
  were updated.

Compatibility
-------------
- QGIS 3.16 and newer, including QGIS 4 / Qt 6.
- Python 3.9+.
- Windows is the primary target; the plugin uses QGIS and PyQt APIs.

Installation
------------
1. Download `zgeo-1.36.0.zip`.
2. In QGIS open Plugins → Manage and Install Plugins → Install from ZIP.
3. Select the downloaded archive and restart QGIS if it was running.

