Version 1.32.0 — 2026-11-16
Previous GitHub release: v1.30.0 (2026-11-15)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.32.0 adds a side panel with detailed descriptions, actions and
examples for every check in the "Checks" window.

Changes in 1.32.0
-----------------
- Clicking the "i" button next to a check now opens a detail panel on the
  right instead of showing a tooltip only.
- The panel explains what the check does, what actions will be performed
  and gives practical examples for the check.
- The panel can be closed with the "×" button, and clicking another "i"
  button switches its contents.
- The window expands when the panel opens and returns to its compact size
  when the panel is closed.
- The check hint now explains that "i" opens a detailed description with
  examples.
- Russian and English interface strings, README, metadata and tests
  were updated.

