Version 1.31.0 — 2026-11-16
Previous GitHub release: v1.30.0 (2026-11-15)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.31.0 makes the bottom progress label show only the check that is
currently running and formats check durations in reports as readable
text such as "2 minutes 45 seconds".

Changes in 1.31.0
-----------------
- Problem checks now run one after another instead of processing every
  selected check for each file in one pass.
- The bottom progress label shows only the current check; the status bar
  shows the current check and its file progress.
- Each problem check is timed separately, so the "Check timing" table
  has one row per executed check.
- Excel and HTML reports show durations in human-readable form, for
  example "2 minutes 45 seconds" or "less than 1 second".
- Timing uses a high-resolution performance counter so very fast checks
  still report meaningful throughput.
- The metadata and CRS check now also applies to rasters when it is
  selected without the CRS quality check.
- Russian and English interface strings, README, metadata and tests
  were updated.

Compatibility
-------------
- QGIS 3.16 and newer, including QGIS 4 / Qt 6.
- Python 3.9+.
- Windows is the primary target; the plugin uses QGIS and PyQt APIs.

Installation
------------
1. Download `zgeo-1.31.0.zip`.
2. In QGIS open Plugins → Manage and Install Plugins → Install from ZIP.
3. Select the downloaded archive and restart QGIS if it was running.

