Version 1.30.0 — 2026-11-15
Previous GitHub release: v1.27.0 (2026-11-13)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.30.0 measures how long checks take and adds the results to the
Excel and HTML reports, including throughput in files per second and per
minute.

Changes in 1.30.0
-----------------
- Every check operation is timed: JSON validation, problem checks and
  size refinement.
- The report contains a new "Check timing" worksheet in Excel and a new
  "Check timing" section in HTML.
- The timing table has the operation, number of files, elapsed seconds,
  files per second, files per minute and status.
- A "Folder total" row shows the overall duration and throughput for the
  folder.
- Interrupted operations are recorded with the "Interrupted" status.
- Russian and English interface strings, README, metadata and tests
  were updated.

